  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Health development programme in Northwest and Northeast Syria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme includes the components:
1. Blood bank (National Hospital of Al-Raqqa)
2. Thalassemia management (NES)
3. Laboratory and radiology center (National Hospital of Al-Raqqa)
4. Midwifery upgrading programme (NES)
and
Project 1: Support to WATAN 1 Primary Health Care Center
Project 2: Support to Al-Darbasiyah Primary Health Care Center
Project 3: Support to Al-Tabaqah Primary Healthcare Center
Project 4: Support to WATAN-2 Blood bank, laboratory and Oxygen-generator unit
Project 5: Support to WATAN-3 Blood bank, laboratory and Thalassemia clinic
Project 6: Support to WATAN-4 Blood bank and Thalassemia clinic 
Project 7: Support to Nephrology Center and Al-Atareb kidney dialysis unit
Project 8: Support to Sarmada Urology Center</narrative>
  </description>
